    {
      "id": "fcaac104ba8ab0bcc54a2b6fceb3de518cb58264",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3051116259,
          "type": null,
          "body": "there is a build fail with ubuntu runner :\n\n```\ndebian/libwiretap-dev/usr/include/wireshark/wiretap/pcapng_module.h:321:13: error: expected unqualified-id before ‘new’\n  321 |     void *(*new)(void);\n      |             ^~~\ndebian/libwiretap-dev/usr/include/wireshark/wiretap/pcapng_module.h:321:13: error: expected ‘)’ before ‘new’\n  321 |     void *(*new)(void);\n      |           ~ ^~~\n      |             )\n```\n\nCan you look ? \nhttps://launchpadlibrarian.net/845705213/buildlog_ubuntu-questing-arm64.wireshark_4.7.0-0~202602020648~ubuntu25.10.1_BUILDING.txt.gz",
          "author": {
            "id": 279822,
            "username": "alagoutte",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Alexis La Goutte",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a15cba6417f4d1723eb56add7099bcfd8df373dc520577958b33c37915ef231b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/alagoutte"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-02-02T10:48:08.659Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-02-02T10:48:08.659Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 450531208,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23406,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0651b9a06e58530e5ca7404778ac2e5de47c904d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3051463730,
          "type": null,
          "body": "That looks like an issue with `new` being a reserved word in C++ and attempting to compile the header for C++. I suppose it didn't trigger before because the check that all the headers could be compiled didn't run.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:14:14.515Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-02-02T12:14:14.515Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 450531208,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23406,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
